From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Jul 2026 01:15:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 31/49] winewayland: Refine punch through activation.

- Creating a Vulkan surface is not enough to prove that a window is
  presenting into it. Mark Vulkan windows as pixel format clients only once
  a swapchain is created.

- Avoid committing freshly created SHM contents for windows that have not
  painted into their backing store. Track painted regions and keep
  unpainted damage transparent or backed by the previous contents.

- Do not treat erase or copy bits operations as GDI-over-producer paints.

- Limit popup grabs to native menu windows so non-menu popups are not
  dismissed by the compositor.

Fixes issues related to Assetto Corsa game start and content manager app
issues.
